Data Dictionary for Gold Layer

Overview
The Gold Layer is the business-level data representation, structures to support analytical and reporting use cases. It consists of dimension
tables and fact tables for specific business metrics. 
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. gold.dim_customers
* Purpose: Store customer details enriched with demographic and geographic data.
* Columns:
customer_key              INT                  Surrogate key uniquely identifying each customer record in the dimension table
customer_id               INT                  Unique numerical identifier assigned to each customer
customer_number           NVARCHAR(50)         Alphanumeric identifier representing the customer, for traking and refrencing
first_name                NVARCHAR(50)         first name of customer
last_name                 NVARCHAR(50)         last name of customer
country                   NVARCHAR(50)         country of cutomer('United States')
marital_status            NVARCHAR(50)         marital status of customer(Single, Married, Unknown)
gender                    NVARCHAR(50)         gender of customers(Male, Female, Unknown)
================================================================================================================================

2. gold.dim_products
* Purpose: Provides information about products
* Columns:
product_key                INT                  Surrogate key uniquely identifying each customer record in the dimension table
product_id                 INT                  Unique numerical identifier assigned to each customer
product_number             NVARCHAR(50)          Alphanumeric identifier representing the customer, for traking and refrencing
product_name               NVARCHAR(50)         first name of customer
category_id                NVARCHAR(50)         last name of customer
category                   NVARCHAR(50)         country of cutomer('United States')
subcategory                NVARCHAR(50)         marital status of customer(Single, Married, Unknown)
maintenance                NVARCHAR(50)         gender of customers(Male, Female, Unknown)
cost                       INT
product_line               NVARCHAR(50)
start_date                 DATE
================================================================================================================================

3. gold.fact_sales
* Purpose: Stored transactional sales data for analytical purpose
* Columns:
order_number               NVARCHAR(50)          unique alphanumetric identifier for each sales order ('SO54496')
product_key                INT                   surrogate key linking the order to the product dimension table 
customer_key               INT                   surrogate key linking the order to customer dimension table 
order_date                 DATE                  date in which order was placed
shipping_date              DATE                  date in which the order was shipped 
due_date                   DATE                  the date in which the order payment was due
sales_amount               INT                   the total value of sale for the item in whole currency units
quantity                   INT                   the number of units of the productthat has been ordered
price                      INT                   the price of product per unit for the line item in whole currency

================================================================================================================================
